sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Listener as Praxis Proxy Listener<br/>8080/TCP HTTP/HTTPS
    participant TLS as TLS Termination<br/>OpenSSL Provider<br/>TLS 1.2+/1.3
    participant Pipeline as Filter Pipeline<br/>(ArcSwap immutable)
    participant Security as Security Filters<br/>(CORS/CSRF/IP ACL/<br/>mTLS/Policy/Guardrails)
    participant Traffic as Traffic Mgmt Filters<br/>(Router/Load Balancer/<br/>Rate Limit)
    participant Transform as Transform Filters<br/>(Header/Path Rewrite/<br/>JSON Body)
    participant Upstream as Upstream Cluster<br/>Configurable Port

    Note over Client,Upstream: Flow 1: HTTP Request Proxying

    Client->>Listener: HTTP/HTTPS Request<br/>Port 8080/TCP
    alt TLS Enabled
        Listener->>TLS: TLS Handshake<br/>SNI-based cert selection
        TLS-->>Listener: Decrypted request
        Note over TLS: Optional mTLS:<br/>Client cert verification<br/>(None/Request/Require/<br/>RequireNamed with SPIFFE)
    end
    Listener->>Pipeline: Forward to filter pipeline
    Pipeline->>Security: Request phase filters
    Note over Security: Reserved headers<br/>(x-praxis-*) rejected<br/>with 400 if present
    Security->>Traffic: Route selection<br/>Load balancing decision
    Traffic->>Transform: Header/path/body<br/>transformation
    Transform->>Upstream: Proxied request<br/>(optional upstream TLS/mTLS)
    Upstream-->>Transform: Backend response
    Transform-->>Traffic: Response transformation
    Traffic-->>Security: Response filters
    Note over Security: Reserved headers<br/>stripped from response
    Security-->>Pipeline: Filtered response
    Pipeline-->>Listener: Response
    Listener-->>Client: HTTP/HTTPS Response

    Note over Client,Upstream: Flow 2: Health Check and Metrics

    participant Monitor as Monitoring /<br/>Container Health
    participant Admin as Admin API<br/>9902/TCP HTTP

    Monitor->>Admin: GET /healthy<br/>Port 9902/TCP (HTTP, no TLS)
    Admin-->>Monitor: Health status

    Monitor->>Admin: GET /metrics<br/>Port 9902/TCP (HTTP, no TLS)
    Admin-->>Monitor: Prometheus metrics

    Note over Client,Upstream: Flow 3: Hot-Reload (Config + Certs)

    participant FS as Filesystem Watcher
    participant Reload as Hot-Reload Engine

    FS->>Reload: Config/cert file change detected
    Reload->>Pipeline: Build new FilterPipeline
    Note over Reload,Pipeline: Atomic swap via ArcSwap<br/>In-flight requests see<br/>consistent pipeline generation
    Reload->>TLS: Reload certificates<br/>(symlink-aware)
